# Claude Code local state. Both were previously ignored only by a
# developer's global gitignore / .git/info/exclude, which does not travel
# to another clone: settings.local.json is per-machine tool permissions,
# and scheduled_tasks.lock is runtime state (a session id and a live PID).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
